        <headline>Warning to Sheep Graziers for Snowy Mountains forecast district</headline>
        <description>Sheep graziers are warned that cold temperatures and northwesterly winds are expected during Friday. Areas likely to be affected include parts of the Snowy Mountains forecast district. There is a risk of losses of lambs and sheep exposed to these conditions.</description>
